	\uses{def:pasting-tensor-placement}
	Let $G_{g_2}$ be a measurement on the second tensor factor, let $Q_{a_2}$ be
	its coarse-graining along an evaluation map, let $P_{a_1}$ be a measurement,
	and let $\ket{\psi}$ be a state. Then
	\[
		\sum_{a_2} \bra{\psi} Q_{a_2} \ot
				\sum_{a_1} P_{a_1} Q_{a_2} P_{a_1} \ket{\psi}
			- \sum_{g_2} \bra{\psi} G_{g_2} \ot
